# Input URL

A URL input field with a prefix for protocols and an information tooltip.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-url.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-url.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/input-url.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { InputURL } from '@/registry/input-url'

const website = ref('')
</script>

<template>
  <InputURL 
    v-model="website" 
    protocol="https://" 
    hint="Enter your domain name without protocol" 
    placeholder="mysite.com" 
  />
</template>
```

